      "style": "h2",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "kpgcufcyiun",
          "text": "What HYROX does to your body",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": []
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "xd0a68hk7m",
      "style": "normal",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "4gxzxj5q3t4",
          "text": "HYROX is eight 1 km runs broken up by functional stations. The load is repetitive and full-body, but certain muscles take a disproportionate hit:",
