      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "2mlapnn2vv6",
          "text": "Research on mixed-modal racing shows DOMS peaks 48–72 hours after unfamiliar eccentric work, sled and lunges qualify for most people. Plan your week accordingly.",
